  "description": "The Go Zoom is a sleek and reliable electric scooter designed for commuting, casual riding, and effortless city travel. Powered by a 350W rear hub motor and a 36V 7.8Ah lithium battery, it reaches speeds of up to 15.5 mph and offers a range of up to 18 miles on a single charge.\nWeighing just 22 lbs, the Go Zoom features a foldable, lightweight frame that's easy to carry, store, or take on public transit. Its solid 8.5-inch tires are puncture-proof and maintenance-free, while the responsive disc brake system ensures confident stopping in any condition.\nAn integrated LED display keeps key riding data—speed, battery level, light status, and gear mode—clearly visible at a glance. Front and rear LED lights, including an automatic brake light, enhance your visibility and safety, day or night.\nWhether you're new to e-scooters or looking for a dependable daily ride, the Go Zoom delivers a smooth, intuitive riding experience with three selectable speed modes to suit your style. It’s a practical, user-friendly choice built with everyday riders in mind.\n\n16mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 18 miles Range\n\n350 WHub Motor\n\n36V7.8 Ah",
